%N A395445 Numbers k such that sigma(k) = psi(k) + tau(k)^5 + Omega(k)^5.
%C A395445 From _David A. Corneth_, Apr 28 2026: (Start)
%C A395445 Contains 218617*p^2 where p is prime and gcd(218617, p) = 1.
%C A395445 Contains 247777*p^2 where p is prime and gcd(247777, p) = 1.
%C A395445 Hence the sequence is infinite. (End)
%F A395445 Union of 37 sporadic terms { 228069, 177685564, 180245260, 184212364, 185514196, 186378164, 187621196, 207270388, 214571188, 538724729, 1580878915, 1817908477, 1881941677, 2310313769, 9176483173, 9557118493, 9683996933, 13200973164, 1808126191869, 6272604182880, 6639974822880, 6640516723680, 6854272830225, 6929068096575, 6955394101920, 6990909992775, 7000520557725, 7039798518825, 7046782593975, 7050125399175, 7061108901975, 7304298924384, 7429683739680, 7481548285920, 7818744828384, 7998765898464, 8240240506464 } and 43 infinite families { m*p^2 : p is prime not dividing m } for m in { 218617, 247777, 106171530, 124510026, 126225546, 126761226, 127187826, 138940030, 139595230, 140488330, 141317830, 141341630, 141406730, 145886846, 153751366, 154274098, 154927498, 155468522, 156307335, 156789266, 157464166, 158206318, 158947858, 159217138, 159620038, 159779206, 160172198, 162934826, 165173546, 166385126, 167905898, 168159722, 168500798, 177146511, 183833155, 191040355, 196827955, 207920855, 209705555, 228520259, 236864723, 158171635461, 159169797003 }. - _Max Alekseyev_, Oct 24 2026
%e A395445 228069 is a term since sigma(228069) = 337920 = 304128 + 8^5 + 4^5 = psi(228069) + tau(228069)^5 + Omega(228069)^5.
%o A395445 (PARI) isok(k) = {my(f = factor(k)); sigma(f) == prod(i=1, #f~, (f[i, 1]+1) * f[i, 1]^(f[i, 2]-1)) + numdiv(f)^5 + bigomega(f)^5; } \\ _Amiram Eldar_, Apr 23 2026
